WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.955
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Games!

2
00:00:05.255 --> 00:00:07.664
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:07.964 --> 00:00:10.172
Today's topic is Playground Games.

4
00:00:11.183 --> 00:00:14.695
Today we play games with words. Are you ready?

5
00:00:14.995 --> 00:00:17.519
Yes! Let's play!

6
00:00:18.517 --> 00:00:19.947
Hide and seek!

7
00:00:20.847 --> 00:00:23.058
Hide and seek. Your turn!

8
00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:27.436
Hide and seek!

9
00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:28.806
Great!

10
00:00:29.817 --> 00:00:30.411
Tag!

11
00:00:31.311 --> 00:00:33.348
Tag. Your turn!

12
00:00:36.248 --> 00:00:37.157
Tag!

13
00:00:37.457 --> 00:00:38.597
Wonderful!

14
00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:40.805
Hopscotch!

15
00:00:41.705 --> 00:00:43.939
Hopscotch. Your turn!

16
00:00:46.839 --> 00:00:48.270
Hopscotch!

17
00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:49.571
Super!

18
00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:51.608
Jump rope!

19
00:00:52.508 --> 00:00:54.452
Jump rope. Your turn!

20
00:00:57.352 --> 00:00:58.597
Jump rope!

21
00:00:58.897 --> 00:00:59.840
Excellent!

22
00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:04.429
Look at the picture and say the word before I do!

23
00:01:05.417 --> 00:01:07.918
What is it? Can you say it?

24
00:01:10.818 --> 00:01:13.227
Hopscotch! Well done!

25
00:01:14.217 --> 00:01:16.439
What is it? Can you say it?

26
00:01:19.339 --> 00:01:21.226
Tag! Well done!

27
00:01:22.217 --> 00:01:25.032
What is it? Can you say it?

28
00:01:27.932 --> 00:01:30.247
Sandbox! Well done!

29
00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:33.879
What is it? Can you say it?

30
00:01:36.779 --> 00:01:38.828
Jump rope! Well done!

31
00:01:39.817 --> 00:01:42.524
Say each word as fast as you can.

32
00:01:42.824 --> 00:01:52.702
Hide and seek! Tag! Hopscotch! Jump rope! Seesaw! Monkey bars! Sandbox! Tug of war!

33
00:01:56.002 --> 00:01:57.688
Wow, so fast!

34
00:01:58.683 --> 00:02:05.924
I say five words. Remember them! Hide and seek, Hopscotch, Tag, Seesaw, Sandbox.

35
00:02:10.224 --> 00:02:11.899
I remember them all!

36
00:02:12.883 --> 00:02:15.930
You played so well. Everyone is a winner!

37
00:02:16.917 --> 00:02:22.509
Great job today, everyone! See you next time. Bye-bye!

38
00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:23.833
Bye-bye!

